Subject: [PATCH] provenance: the first log line names the build (entry, exe,
 commit, translator, every NX2NAVI_* setting), and build.txt holds it beside
 every dump, flight dump, RenderDoc capture, shots folder, mark ring and
 requested shot (shot-<n>.build.txt); input recordings carry it in their
 header, so a symptom is never filed against the wrong build

